<closer><dateline><hi rendition="#fr"> Mitau, den<lb/>
1&#x017F;ten Junii
1789.</hi></dateline>
<lb/>
<signed>
<hi rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#fr">Johann David Huhn,</hi>
